{"seq":3,"slug":"moq-case-multiple-ordering","title":"起订量/整箱倍数下单约束","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/unit-measure-packsize-conversion/pack-hierarchy/moq-case-multiple-ordering","wordCount":1896,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"起订量-整箱倍数下单约束\">起订量/整箱倍数下单约束</h1><p>客户想买 5 个，供应商只按箱发，一箱 12 个。系统要么拒绝，要么最小卖 12 个，要么按 5 个卖但库存拆零、成本上升。这三种处理没有绝对优劣，问题是<strong>由谁决定</strong>——如果这个决定散落在购物车校验、下单接口、库存预占、财务开票四处各写一遍，它们迟早会给出不一致的答案。</p>\n<p>这一篇讲的是把&quot;能买多少&quot;这件事收敛成一条显式约束。它的难点不在算术，而在三个粒度（each 级销售、case 级发运、pallet 级起订）必须同时成立，且彼此不矛盾。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>下单约束的本质是一个<strong>可行数量集合</strong>，由三条独立规则的交集定义：下限（MOQ）、步长（倍数）、粒度（拆箱许可与库存可拣粒度）。三条规则的语义互不覆盖——只知道 MOQ 无法推出步长，只知道步长无法推出下限——因此不能压缩成一条&quot;最小可购量&quot;。</p>\n<p>这个集合的两个性质决定了实现方式：它必须在<strong>每次下单时求值</strong>（因为约束会变），且求值结果必须<strong>可解释</strong>（客户需要知道为什么 5 变成了 12）。这就把约束求值从一段散落的校验逻辑，变成一个有明确输入输出的纯函数——输入是数量与约束版本，输出是合法数量与调整说明。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三条约束的语义\">三条约束的语义</h2><h3 id=\"moq-总量下限\">MOQ：总量下限</h3><p>起订量（Minimum Order Quantity，MOQ）规定一次订单中该 SKU 的<strong>最小总量</strong>。它有两种存在形式：按销售单位计（&quot;至少 5 件&quot;）或按金额计（&quot;该 SKU 小计不低于 100 美元&quot;）。前者约束数量，后者约束价值，语义不同，不能互相代替。</p>\n<h3 id=\"倍数-步长约束\">倍数：步长约束</h3><p>整箱倍数（order multiple / pack multiple）规定可购数量的<strong>步长</strong>：必须是 12 的整数倍。它与 MOQ 是两条独立约束——12 是倍数、24 是 MOQ，则合法的数量是 24、36、48…。把两者合并成一条&quot;最小 24&quot;会丢失步长信息，允许客户下单 25。</p>\n<h3 id=\"层级上限-包装容量约束\">层级上限：包装容量约束</h3><p>第三个约束来自包装本身：单笔订单是否允许拆箱发运。若不允许，则数量必须是 <code>pack_size</code> 的整数倍；若允许但需加收拆零费，则约束变成&quot;允许但不默认&quot;。</p>\n<p>这条约束的物理依据是包装层级本身：外箱（case）作为可独立交易的贸易项，与前一级（each）之间是<strong>聚合</strong>而非<strong>换算</strong>关系，因此&quot;半箱&quot;不是合法的库存形态（<a href=\"each-inner-case-pallet-hierarchy\">each/inner/case/pallet 包装层级</a>）。国际条码体系同样以此为界——零售单元用 UPC/EAN 标识，箱级则用承载 GTIN-14 的 ITF-14 条码，两级各有一个独立标识（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ITF-14\">ITF-14 与箱级标识</a>）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>约束</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>单位</th>\n<th>典型取值</th>\n<th>违反后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>MOQ</td>\n<td>一次订购的最小量</td>\n<td>销售单位</td>\n<td>24</td>\n<td>供应商拒单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>倍数</td>\n<td>数量的步长</td>\n<td>销售单位</td>\n<td>12</td>\n<td>产线无法按箱备货</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拆箱许可</td>\n<td>是否允许非整箱</td>\n<td>布尔</td>\n<td>false（B2B 常见）</td>\n<td>发运环节无法履约</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>托盘起订</td>\n<td>干线运输最小托数</td>\n<td>托盘</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>运费不经济</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>库存粒度</td>\n<td>仓库最小可拣粒度</td>\n<td>库存单位</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>拣货失败</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后两行的区别值得单独说明：<strong>下单约束</strong>决定客户能买多少，<strong>库存粒度</strong>决定仓库能拣多少。两者可以不同——客户必须买整箱，但仓库可以拆箱拣出整箱的量（因为已从托盘拆下）。把两者混为一谈，就会出现&quot;客户只能按托盘下单&quot;这种过度收紧。</p>\n<h2 id=\"约束的求值顺序\">约束的求值顺序</h2><h3 id=\"从右到左逐层应用\">从右到左逐层应用</h3><p>给定客户输入的量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span>（销售单位），求值应当自下而上：先按库存粒度取整，再按倍数取整，最后校验 MOQ。顺序错了会得到不同结果——先取倍数再取库存粒度，可能得到一个库存拣不出的量。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[客户输入数量 q] --&gt; B{库存粒度检查}&#10;  B --&gt;|q 非库存粒度倍数| B1[向上取整到库存粒度]&#10;  B --&gt;|通过| C&#10;  B1 --&gt; C{倍数检查}&#10;  C --&gt;|q 非 pack_size 倍数| C1[向上取整到 pack_size 倍数&lt;br/&gt;并提示最小可购量]&#10;  C --&gt;|通过| D&#10;  C1 --&gt; D{MOQ 检查}&#10;  D --&gt;|q 小于 MOQ| D1[调整到 MOQ&lt;br/&gt;向上取到步长]&#10;  D --&gt;|通过| E[输出合法数量 q*]&#10;  D1 --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; F[写入订单行&lt;br/&gt;记录生效的约束版本]\">graph TD\n  A[客户输入数量 q] --&gt; B{库存粒度检查}\n  B --&gt;|q 非库存粒度倍数| B1[向上取整到库存粒度]\n  B --&gt;|通过| C\n  B1 --&gt; C{倍数检查}\n  C --&gt;|q 非 pack_size 倍数| C1[向上取整到 pack_size 倍数&lt;br/&gt;并提示最小可购量]\n  C --&gt;|通过| D\n  C1 --&gt; D{MOQ 检查}\n  D --&gt;|q 小于 MOQ| D1[调整到 MOQ&lt;br/&gt;向上取到步长]\n  D --&gt;|通过| E[输出合法数量 q*]\n  D1 --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; F[写入订单行&lt;br/&gt;记录生效的约束版本]</pre><p>注意每一步都<strong>向上取整</strong>而非四舍五入：向下取整会让数量少于客户意图，向上取整只是让客户多买一点并明确告知。这一点在 B2B 场景是硬要求。</p>\n<h3 id=\"取整必须告知\">取整必须告知</h3><p>把 5 调整为 12 而不告知，是导致客诉的直接原因。所以求值函数除了返回数量，还必须返回&quot;调整原因与最小合法量&quot;，供前端提示。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;order_qty_eval&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;input_qty&quot;: 5,&#10;    &quot;output_qty&quot;: 12,&#10;    &quot;adjustments&quot;: [&#10;      { &quot;rule&quot;: &quot;STOCK_GRANULARITY&quot;, &quot;from&quot;: 5, &quot;to&quot;: 5, &quot;applied&quot;: false },&#10;      { &quot;rule&quot;: &quot;CASE_MULTIPLE&quot;, &quot;step&quot;: 12, &quot;from&quot;: 5, &quot;to&quot;: 12, &quot;applied&quot;: true },&#10;      { &quot;rule&quot;: &quot;MOQ&quot;, &quot;min&quot;: 12, &quot;applied&quot;: false }&#10;    ],&#10;    &quot;message&quot;: &quot;该商品按整箱销售，一箱 12 件，最小可购 12 件&quot;,&#10;    &quot;constraint_version&quot;: &quot;2026-09-01&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"order_qty_eval\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"input_qty\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"output_qty\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"adjustments\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"rule\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"STOCK_GRANULARITY\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"from\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"to\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"applied\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"rule\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CASE_MULTIPLE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"step\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"from\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"to\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"applied\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"rule\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"MOQ\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"min\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"applied\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"message\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"该商品按整箱销售，一箱 12 件，最小可购 12 件\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"constraint_version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-01\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>constraint_version</code> 是必要的：约束会变（供应商调整 MOQ），历史订单必须能还原到当时生效的约束，才能解释&quot;为什么这单是 24 而不是 12&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"约束的数据模型\">约束的数据模型</h2><h3 id=\"按渠道与市场分层\">按渠道与市场分层</h3><p>同一个 SKU 对 B2B 客户可能按托盘起订、对 B2C 客户可单件购买。因此约束的绑定键至少包含渠道维度。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE order_constraint (&#10;  sku_id          text NOT NULL,&#10;  channel_code    text NOT NULL,        -- B2B / B2C / RETAIL&#10;  market_code     text NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;*&#39;,&#10;  moq_qty         numeric(18,6) NOT NULL DEFAULT 1,&#10;  order_multiple  numeric(18,6) NOT NULL DEFAULT 1,&#10;  allow_partial_case boolean NOT NULL DEFAULT true,&#10;  pallet_moq      numeric(18,6),&#10;  stock_granularity numeric(18,6) NOT NULL DEFAULT 1,&#10;  uom_code        text NOT NULL,        -- 约束所用单位&#10;  effective_from  date NOT NULL,&#10;  effective_to    date,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (sku_id, channel_code, market_code, effective_from),&#10;  CONSTRAINT chk_multiple CHECK (order_multiple &gt; 0),&#10;  CONSTRAINT chk_moq_multiple CHECK (&#10;    MOD(moq_qty::numeric, order_multiple) = 0 OR order_multiple = 0),&#10;  CONSTRAINT chk_granularity CHECK (stock_granularity &gt; 0)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> order_constraint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sku_id          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  channel_code    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- B2B / B2C / RETAIL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  market_code     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '*'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  moq_qty         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  order_multiple  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  allow_partial_case </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">boolean</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> true,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  pallet_moq      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  stock_granularity </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  uom_code        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 约束所用单位</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  effective_from  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  effective_to    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (sku_id, channel_code, market_code, effective_from),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> chk_multiple </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (order_multiple </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> chk_moq_multiple </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    MOD(moq_qty::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, order_multiple) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> OR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_multiple </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> chk_granularity </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (stock_granularity </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>chk_moq_multiple</code> 拦的是配置错误：MOQ 若本身不是倍数的整数倍，那么&quot;满足 MOQ 的最小合法量&quot;会大于 MOQ，配置者显然写错了。</p>\n<h3 id=\"单位一致性\">单位一致性</h3><p><code>uom_code</code> 字段的存在是因为约束可能在销售单位上定义，而库存粒度在基本单位上定义。二者必须能换算互通，否则求值会静默出错。这条一致性由 <a href=\"../uom-pricing-inventory/base-unit-inventory-multiuom\">基准单位库存与多单位库存</a> 的基准单位模型保证——约束求值时先把所有量归一到基准单位再比较。</p>\n<h2 id=\"求值的实现\">求值的实现</h2><h3 id=\"一个纯函数\">一个纯函数</h3><p>求值逻辑应当是一个无副作用的纯函数：输入（输入量、约束、库存粒度、单位换算图），输出（合法量与调整说明）。把 IO、缓存、告警挡在它之外，这样它可以被穷举测试。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def resolve_order_qty(q, c, uom_graph):&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;返回 (legal_qty, adjustments)。全部按基准单位计算。&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    qb = to_base(q, c.uom_code, uom_graph)&#10;    adj = []&#10;&#10;    g = c.stock_granularity&#10;    qb_r = ceil_to(qb, g)&#10;    if qb_r != qb:&#10;        adj.append((&quot;STOCK_GRANULARITY&quot;, qb, qb_r))&#10;        qb = qb_r&#10;&#10;    m = c.order_multiple&#10;    qb_r = ceil_to(qb, m)&#10;    if qb_r != qb:&#10;        adj.append((&quot;CASE_MULTIPLE&quot;, qb, qb_r))&#10;        qb = qb_r&#10;&#10;    if qb &lt; c.moq_qty:&#10;        qb = ceil_to(c.moq_qty, m)&#10;        adj.append((&quot;MOQ&quot;, c.moq_qty, qb))&#10;&#10;    return from_base(qb, c.uom_code, uom_graph), adj&#10;&#10;&#10;def ceil_to(x, step):&#10;    if step &lt;= 0:&#10;        return x&#10;    return math.ceil(x / step - 1e-12) * step\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> resolve_order_qty</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(q, c, uom_graph):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"返回 (legal_qty, adjustments)。全部按基准单位计算。\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    qb </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> to_base(q, c.uom_code, uom_graph)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    adj </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    g </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c.stock_granularity</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    qb_r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ceil_to(qb, g)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> qb_r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> qb:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        adj.append((</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"STOCK_GRANULARITY\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, qb, qb_r))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        qb </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> qb_r</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    m </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c.order_multiple</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    qb_r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ceil_to(qb, m)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> qb_r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> qb:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        adj.append((</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CASE_MULTIPLE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, qb, qb_r))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        qb </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> qb_r</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> qb </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c.moq_qty:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        qb </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ceil_to(c.moq_qty, m)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        adj.append((</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"MOQ\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, c.moq_qty, qb))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> from_base(qb, c.uom_code, uom_graph), adj</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ceil_to</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(x, step):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> step </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> math.ceil(x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> step </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1e-12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> step</span></span></code></pre></div><p>那个 <code>1e-12</code> 的减法是必要的：<code>math.ceil(12.0 / 12)</code> 在浮点下可能因为 <code>12.0/12</code> 得到 <code>1.0000000000000002</code> 而错误地向上取到 24。用定点小数实现更好，但纯浮点实现必须带这个容差。</p>\n<h3 id=\"求值时机\">求值时机</h3><p>约束应当在<strong>加入购物车时、下单确认时、库存预占时</strong>各求一次。三次结果必须一致；若不一致，说明中间约束被修改了，应当以<strong>最新版本</strong>为准并让订单回到确认步骤，而不是静默采用其中一个。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与定价-库存的交界\">与定价、库存的交界</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>定价</strong>：整箱价与单件价的折算必须自洽。若整箱 12 件售 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>47.88</mn><mtext>、单件</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">47.88、单件</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">47.88</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">、单件</span></span></span></span></span>3.99，则 12 件的整数倍订单不应出现&quot;整箱价低于单件价乘 12&quot;的矛盾（除非是刻意的量折）。见 <a href=\"../uom-pricing-inventory/unit-price-per-kg-l-oz\">每单位/每升/每百克价折算与展示</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>库存</strong>：约束求值只保证&quot;能下单&quot;，不保证&quot;有货&quot;。可售库存以基准单位存储并按库存粒度可拣，见 <a href=\"../uom-pricing-inventory/base-unit-inventory-multiuom\">基准单位库存与多单位库存</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>报关</strong>：下单量是销售单位，报关量是法定单位，两者之间隔着包装层级与换算链，见 <a href=\"../uom-customs-rounding/uom-consistency-validation\">订单/库存/发票单位一致性校验</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>&quot;能买多少&quot;由三条独立约束共同决定：MOQ（总量下限）、倍数（步长）、拆箱许可（层级容量）；三者不能合并成一条。</li>\n<li>下单约束与库存粒度是两个不同概念：前者决定客户能买多少，后者决定仓库能拣多少。</li>\n<li>求值顺序自下而上（库存粒度 → 倍数 → MOQ），每一步向上取整，并把调整原因返回给前端。</li>\n<li>约束按 SKU × 渠道 × 市场分层，带生效期与版本号，历史订单可还原当时约束。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>进入第 3 章 <a href=\"../uom-pricing-inventory/\">单位计价与库存</a>，看这些单位与层级如何落到价格与库存账上。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"起订量/整箱倍数下单约束","id":"起订量-整箱倍数下单约束"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"三条约束的语义","id":"三条约束的语义"},{"level":3,"text":"MOQ：总量下限","id":"moq-总量下限"},{"level":3,"text":"倍数：步长约束","id":"倍数-步长约束"},{"level":3,"text":"层级上限：包装容量约束","id":"层级上限-包装容量约束"},{"level":2,"text":"约束的求值顺序","id":"约束的求值顺序"},{"level":3,"text":"从右到左逐层应用","id":"从右到左逐层应用"},{"level":3,"text":"取整必须告知","id":"取整必须告知"},{"level":2,"text":"约束的数据模型","id":"约束的数据模型"},{"level":3,"text":"按渠道与市场分层","id":"按渠道与市场分层"},{"level":3,"text":"单位一致性","id":"单位一致性"},{"level":2,"text":"求值的实现","id":"求值的实现"},{"level":3,"text":"一个纯函数","id":"一个纯函数"},{"level":3,"text":"求值时机","id":"求值时机"},{"level":2,"text":"与定价、库存的交界","id":"与定价-库存的交界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"箱规/装箱数/托盘层高（Ti-Hi）（联165）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/unit-measure-packsize-conversion/pack-hierarchy/case-pack-ti-hi-spec"},"next":{"title":"每单位/每升/每百克价折算与展示","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/unit-measure-packsize-conversion/uom-pricing-inventory/unit-price-per-kg-l-oz"}}